@startuml SD-14-complete-job
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam wrapWidth 300
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-14: Complete Job (UC-14)
' Traces: UC-14; FR-39, FR-53, FR-66; NFR-08, NFR-09, NFR-12
' Sources: DEC-69; INT-DCT [Questionnaire C18: DB01/DB02]; DEC-39, DEC-40; DEC-55, DEC-56; sequence-diagram-review.md.
' Round-2 source: DEC-58; sequence-diagram-review-round-2.md.
actor Technician
boundary ":JobCompletionPage" as Page
control ":CompletionController" as CC
entity ":Job" as Job
entity ":AuditLog" as AL

Technician -> Page : completeJob(job)
activate Page
Page -> CC ++ : canComplete(user, job)
CC -> CC : checkCurrentState(user, job)
CC --> Page -- : allowed / refused
alt Driver, outside Crew or Job not Assigned
  Page --> Technician : refuse; show current state
else eligible Technician
  Technician -> Page : enter(completionDetails)
  note over Page, CC : actual times, remark, follow-up, invoice photo
  alt offline
    Page -> Page : queueCompletion(job, details)
    Page --> Technician : saved locally / waiting; photo status
  else online
    Page --> Technician : submitting; not yet confirmed
  end
  opt online submission, automatic reconnect or queued retry
    opt explicit retry of a retained item
      Technician -> Page : retryUpload(job)
    end
    Page --> Technician : uploading; retain details and photo
    Page -> CC ++ : submitCompletion(job, details)
    CC -> CC : validate(details)
    group atomic validation and completion save
      CC -> CC : checkCurrentState(user, job)
      alt already Completed
        CC --> Page : current completion; no second credit
      else no authority, not Assigned or invalid details/photo
        CC --> Page : refused; current state / error
      else still eligible and valid
        CC -> Job : complete(details)
        Job -> Job : actualHours()
        CC -> AL : record(Technician, Job completed)
      end
    end
    alt eligible completion committed with photo
      CC --> Page : received; Completed; Workload updated
      Page --> Technician : details and photo received
    else transport/photo/save fails after NFR-09 retries
      CC --> Page : Not saved; identify failed part
      Page --> Technician : failed; retained for retry
    else refused or already Completed
      Page --> Technician : current outcome; queued item retained for review
    end
    deactivate CC
  end
end

deactivate Page
legend bottom
Each queued Job shows local/waiting, uploading, received or failed,
and its invoice-photo status. A local save is not a server completion.
On reconnect, queued items submit automatically through the same path.
Failure retains details/photo for retry; no retyping is required.
Repeated taps/retries cannot complete the Job or credit hours twice.
Confirm success only after both details and required photo are saved.
Changed-Job/Crew or another Technician's completion remains an open
reconciliation question; do not silently overwrite or discard the item.
Actual Hours replace Planned Hours; completed-work credit is preserved.
endlegend
@enduml
